#### b. `test_matching_cards`
- **Key Functionality:** This test checks the match functionality between two flipped cards.
- **Pseudocode:**
```pseudocode
CLASS Card
    FUNCTION is_match(other)
        RETURN self.image == other.image

CLASS Game
    FUNCTION check_match()
        SET flipped_cards TO [card FOR card IN self.cards IF card.is_face_up]
        IF LENGTH(flipped_cards) == 2 THEN
            IF flipped_cards[0].is_match(flipped_cards[1]) THEN
                INCREMENT self.score BY 1
            ELSE
                SLEEP for 1 second
                FOR EACH card IN flipped_cards DO
                    CALL card.flip()
```

