|Case|:**game_initialization_and_card_setup**
```pseudocode
CLASS Card
    FUNCTION __init__(value):
        SET self.face_up = False
        SET self.value = value

CLASS Game
    FUNCTION __init__():
        CREATE self.cards AS LIST
        FOR i FROM 1 TO 8:
            APPEND NEW Card(i) TO self.cards (twice for pairs)
        SET self.score = 0
        SET self.time = 0
        SET self.game_over = False
        SET self.first_card = None
        SET self.second_card = None

CALL Game.__init__()
```
|Case|:**data_storage**
```pseudocode
CLASS Game
    FUNCTION load_game_state():
        TRY:
            OPEN 'gamestate.txt' FOR READING AS f
            SET self.score = INT(data[0])
            SET self.time = INT(data[1])
        EXCEPT FileNotFoundError:
            SET self.score = 0
            SET self.time = 0

    FUNCTION save_game_state():
        OPEN 'gamestate.txt' FOR WRITING AS f
        WRITE self.score AND self.time TO f

CALL Game.save_game_state()
CALL Game.load_game_state()
